<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>AI工具与模型HOT</title><link>https://ai-tool-model-hot.pages.dev/</link><description>每天从 19 个信源（16 个 RSS + 3 个 Hugging Face 组织页）收 AI 模型发布与主流智能体更新，按规则打分精选，只显示标题、一句简介与原文链接，不转载全文。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 20:10:29 GMT</lastBuildDate><item><title>Gemini 4 Neon 上线 GitHub Copilot</title><link>https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-18-gemini-4-neon-in-github-copilot</link><description>谷歌新一代模型 Gemini 4 Neon 正式登陆 GitHub Copilot，主打智能体编程、多步工具调用与知识工作。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 21:49:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">f6cf8ded0e75bec96e1b678b6b93caefa289f4d3</guid><source url="https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-18-gemini-4-neon-in-github-copilot">GitHub Copilot Changelog</source></item><item><title>Gemini API 推出 Tool Retrieval：智能体工具按需加载</title><link>https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/developers-tools/gemini-api-tool-retrieval</link><description>Google 在 Gemini API 中推出 Tool Retrieval 预览版，让智能体把庞大工具库留在待命状态、只在需要时加载参数结构，从而省下输入 token 并保持工具选择的准确性。</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 18:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">b00f82b6db94c2e5b3b683ce3a1ae5d0e73a5a6b</guid><source url="https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/developers-tools/gemini-api-tool-retrieval">Google AI Blog</source></item><item><title>Gemini 4 Neon 发布：前沿能力与执行速度兼顾的新成员</title><link>https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-gemini-4-neon</link><description>Gemini 4 家族的新成员，主打复杂编程、知识工作与科学任务的快速端到端完成，定位在 Carbon 与 Hydrogen 之间，兼顾前沿能力与成本效率，已在 Gemini API 与 AI Studio 上线。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 21:35:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">b898a1b2127c5756e1c018cc6a81581a6294cda6</guid><source url="https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-gemini-4-neon">Google DeepMind Blog</source></item><item><title>Claude Code 2.1.328 发布</title><link>https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog#2-1-328</link><description>Claude Code 2.1.328 为 Opus 4.6 与 Sonnet 4.6 在 Bedrock、Google Cloud、Foundry 及应用网关上启用自动模式，免权限交互会话默认进入该模式。</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 01:20:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">9d590322f684fa1fe551fc87f8b69c8f503722b7</guid><source url="https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog#2-1-328">Claude Code Changelog</source></item><item><title>LangSmith Tool Gateway：为智能体提供安全、受治理的工具调用</title><link>https://www.langchain.com/blog/langsmith-tool-gateway</link><description>LangSmith 推出工具网关公开测试版，统一管理智能体每次工具调用的凭证、身份与权限，支持策略、审批与全链路追踪。</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 15:00:01 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">48de2ffa10d67e095529c39e42490addedbe8189</guid><source url="https://www.langchain.com/blog/langsmith-tool-gateway">LangChain Blog</source></item><item><title>GPT-6.2 Astra 与 Sol 接入 GitHub Copilot</title><link>https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-openais-gpt-6-2-astra-and-gpt-6-2-sol-now-available</link><description>OpenAI 的 GPT-6.2 Astra 与 Sol 已在 GitHub Copilot 全面可用，面向智能体编程与代码评审做了强化。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 20:20:29 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">96ff71f54c6e7b4da47668acaa4a513b0085cd1a</guid><source url="https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-openais-gpt-6-2-astra-and-gpt-6-2-sol-now-available">GitHub Copilot Changelog</source></item><item><title>Claude Code 2.1.327 发布</title><link>https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog#2-1-327</link><description>Claude Code 2.1.327 在安装 GitHub 应用改动仓库前先征求确认，并让 MCP 服务器配置可从标准输入读取 JSON。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 23:22:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">2b7a7366c72677641c0dd7f4007e9797114b8bbe</guid><source url="https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog#2-1-327">Claude Code Changelog</source></item><item><title>OpenAI Agents SDK v0.24.0</title><link>https://github.com/openai/openai-agents-python/releases/tag/v0.24.0</link><description>Agents SDK 发布 0.24.0 版，统一运行级函数错误格式并新增 MCP 发现标注，同时改进故障恢复、沙箱安全与链路追踪。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 19:20:04 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">f6af3e2f5c3e509526f2682898852981da3684a7</guid><source url="https://github.com/openai/openai-agents-python/releases/tag/v0.24.0">OpenAI Agents SDK Releases</source></item><item><title>Qwen Code 每夜构建 v0.28.0-nightly.20261118</title><link>https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.28.0-nightly.20261118.d9ac287c9f</link><description>Qwen Code 发布新一期每夜构建，改进托管智能体的定时循环测试，并加固 PR 校验的状态守卫与容器逻辑。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 22:29:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">2cde799921c8c7805802a15d870fa67af71a9275</guid><source url="https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.28.0-nightly.20261118.d9ac287c9f">Qwen Code Releases</source></item><item><title>Pydantic AI v2.71.0 发布</title><link>https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v2.71.0</link><description>Pydantic AI 2.71.0 版上线，改动集中在多智能体对等网络的连接方式与接口命名，并接入新的模型服务商 Stav。</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 02:13:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">77770fa210de2552a66026b4560552e3450b3250</guid><source url="https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v2.71.0">Pydantic AI Releases</source></item><item><title>Walter Isaacson 谈 AI 时代的好奇心与创造力</title><link>https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/ai/dialogues-walter-isaacson</link><description>传记作家 Walter Isaacson 做客谷歌访谈，回顾历史上伟大创新者的经验，探讨在 AI 不断发展的时代如何保持创造力、做出人类判断。</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 17:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">2adef6bfeca022c84be450445d3873ec185273b7</guid><source url="https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/ai/dialogues-walter-isaacson">Google AI Blog</source></item><item><title>OpenAI 性能工厂如何让 ChatGPT 保持快速</title><link>https://openai.com/index/how-openai-performance-factory-keeps-chatgpt-fast</link><description>OpenAI 公开其内部性能保障体系：用 Codex 驱动的工作流持续发现并修复性能问题，让 ChatGPT 在规模增长下依然保持响应速度。</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 08:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">6687f7be62c34e4af8b14ad1fa0bb36ceef40b28</guid><source url="https://openai.com/index/how-openai-performance-factory-keeps-chatgpt-fast">OpenAI News</source></item><item><ti