>335c172adf129f6320dd27d101537fc81f313af7</guid><source url="https://www.langchain.com/blog/announcing-data-annotation-queue">LangChain Blog</source></item><item><title>Devin 面向 Databricks 迁移：少花时间迁移，多花时间构建</title><link>https://devin.ai/blog/devin-for-databricks-migrations</link><description>Devin 与 Databricks 合作，帮助企业更快地从传统数据平台迁移出来，让工程团队把更多时间花在用数据做开发上。</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 15:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">c447f9907a84582bbff95f815e088d45b51993bc</guid><source url="https://devin.ai/blog/devin-for-databricks-migrations">Devin Blog</source></item><item><title>从一百万次评测里学到的经验</title><link>https://kiro.dev/blog/1m-evals-lessons</link><description>Kiro 团队复盘了一百万次评测，指出固定题库加二元通过率的评测方式容易失真，并分享了更靠谱的做法。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 20:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">ec14445f64bf30917f80b0bde0881a0c97f851cb</guid><source url="https://kiro.dev/blog/1m-evals-lessons">Kiro Blog</source></item><item><title>Pydantic AI v2.70.0</title><link>https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v2.70.0</link><description>Pydantic AI 发布 2.70.0，修复了一个高危安全问题：工具输出限制在去掉 ANSI 转义时用的模式可能耗时过长。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 00:12:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">bc05fadfa40fe7597c57a3ccd619234dc38bb42c</guid><source url="https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v2.70.0">Pydantic AI Releases</source></item></channel></rss>
